        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-USDA-STANAG-P2P-THEOREMS-71-75.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-STANAG-P2P-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH71-SELF-CERT-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH72-PDU-COMPACT-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH73-MUTUAL-AUTH-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH74-ANTI-COLLISION-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH75-WINCHESTER-SCSI-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-STANAG-PROOF-WITNESS     PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-STANAG-P2P.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-STANAG-P2P.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH71-SELF-CERT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH72-PDU-COMPACT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH73-MUTUAL-AUTH-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH74-ANTI-COLLISION-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH75-WINCHESTER-SCSI-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-STANAG-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-STANAG-PROOF-WITNESS.
